/Title (def crossover\(self, other: 'NeuralAgent', crossover_rate: float = 0.5\) -> 'NeuralAgent':     child = NeuralAgent\(       n_rays=self.n_rays, n_system_obs=self.n_system_obs, device=self.device     \).to\(self.device\)     g1 = self.get_genome\(\)     g2 = other.get_genome\(\)     mask = torch.rand_like\(g1\) < crossover_rate     child.set_genome\(torch.where\(mask, g1, g2\)\)     return child)
